        <headline>Flash Flood Warning issued September 24 at 9:43PM MDT until September 24 at 9:45PM MDT by NWS Albuquerque NM</headline>
        <description>The flash flood warning has been converted to an areal flood warning
which is in effect until 330 AM MDT. Please refer to that bulletin
for the latest information.

A Flood Watch remains in effect until 600 AM MDT Friday for portions
of central, east central, and southeast New Mexico.
